1
00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:17,520
[We've received numerous anonymous tips,]

2
00:01:17,520 --> 00:01:18,240
[exposing a scandal from 20 years ago.]

3
00:01:18,240 --> 00:01:19,520
[The predecessor of Golden Silk Group,]

4
00:01:19,520 --> 00:01:21,720
[Xingyue Clothing, was accused of using inferior synthetic materials]

5
00:01:21,800 --> 00:01:24,120
[to pass off as silk fabric in their clothing.]

6
00:01:24,160 --> 00:01:26,040
[This caused severe physical and emotional harm]

7
00:01:26,040 --> 00:01:27,800
[to some consumers back then.]

8
00:01:27,880 --> 00:01:28,640
[Next, we have a firsthand witness]

9
00:01:28,640 --> 00:01:29,920
[from that time.]

10
00:01:29,920 --> 00:01:30,600
[To protect their privacy,]

11
00:01:30,600 --> 00:01:32,000
[we've altered their voice.]

12
00:01:32,120 --> 00:01:33,600
[At first, I just felt itchy all over,]

13
00:01:33,800 --> 00:01:34,440
[with red patches.]

14
00:01:34,560 --> 00:01:36,440
[I thought it was an allergic reaction to something I ate.]

15
00:01:36,640 --> 00:01:38,240
[Later, some areas started to ulcerate,]

16
00:01:38,280 --> 00:01:39,560
[and that's when I got really scared.]

17
00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:41,280
[I went to the hospital for a full check-up.]

18
00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:43,880
[The doctor suspected it was likely due to the fabric.]

19
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:45,560
[My skin is very sensitive,]

20
00:01:45,560 --> 00:01:47,200
[especially to synthetic fibers.]

21
00:01:47,240 --> 00:01:48,240
[Later, I recalled that]

22
00:01:48,240 --> 00:01:49,800
the clothes I bought during that time,

23
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:51,240
they were from Xingyue.

24
00:01:51,280 --> 00:01:53,560
I was ready to sue them,

25
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:55,720
but then someone from their company found me

26
00:01:55,720 --> 00:01:56,800
and gave me a large sum of money,

27
00:01:56,800 --> 00:01:58,280
asking me to sign a confidentiality agreement.

28
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:03,680
She actually dared to expose these old stories to the media.

29
00:02:03,920 --> 00:02:05,200
Then we must suppress

30
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:06,440
Su Muchen's matter

31
00:02:06,440 --> 00:02:07,560
and the related evidence.

32
00:02:08,480 --> 00:02:09,680
Send legal notices

33
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:11,400
to all major media outlets,

34
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:13,000
claiming defamation.

35
00:02:13,160 --> 00:02:13,880
And

36
00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:15,280
Jiang Li

37
00:02:19,720 --> 00:02:20,520
can't be suppressed anymore.

38
00:02:21,160 --> 00:02:22,880
The evidence is too direct.

39
00:02:23,240 --> 00:02:24,680
Since the media dares to broadcast it,

40
00:02:25,040 --> 00:02:26,840
it proves they have solid evidence.

41
00:02:27,320 --> 00:02:29,160
Nowadays, information spreads so fast.

42
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:31,480
It's too late.

43
00:02:32,440 --> 00:02:33,480
This matter,

44
00:02:34,200 --> 00:02:36,680
and all the things that shouldn't have happened before,

45
00:02:37,160 --> 00:02:38,360
from the beginning,

46
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:39,800
were all done by me.

47
00:02:40,200 --> 00:02:41,320
All the decisions

48
00:02:42,040 --> 00:02:43,360
were made by me behind your back.

49
00:02:43,440 --> 00:02:44,760
For the benefit of the company,

50
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:47,320
I made the decision on my own.

51
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:50,280
What are you going to do, Mr. Wu?

52
00:02:52,280 --> 00:02:53,320
I'm going to turn myself in.

53
00:02:53,760 --> 00:02:55,440
This is the only way

54
00:02:55,440 --> 00:02:57,720
to end this matter for now.

55
00:02:58,000 --> 00:02:59,760
It's the best way to protect you and the company.

56
00:03:00,440 --> 00:03:01,720
Let all the accusations

57
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:03,760
stop here.

58
00:03:05,040 --> 00:03:05,600
Mr. Wu.

59
00:03:05,760 --> 00:03:06,560
Mr. Wu.

60
00:03:06,840 --> 00:03:08,320
There must be another way.

61
00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:13,720
Remember,

62
00:03:14,160 --> 00:03:15,280
everything

63
00:03:15,600 --> 00:03:16,960
is my personal doing.

64
00:03:17,080 --> 00:03:17,840
It has nothing to do

65
00:03:17,960 --> 00:03:19,560
with you

66
00:03:19,960 --> 00:03:21,000
and the current management.

67
00:03:51,760 --> 00:03:53,320
As the chairman

68
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:56,480
of Golden Thread Fashion Group,

69
00:03:56,560 --> 00:03:59,880
I sincerely apologize to all our friends

70
00:04:00,320 --> 00:04:02,880
for the recent media reports

71
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:07,840
regarding the incidents during the Xingyue Clothing period,

72
00:04:07,840 --> 00:04:10,840
the predecessor of our group.

73
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:13,600
According to our preliminary investigation,

74
00:04:13,600 --> 00:04:14,800
the incident

75
00:04:15,120 --> 00:04:16,160
mainly stems from

76
00:04:16,160 --> 00:04:18,560
the company's immature management system

77
00:04:18,760 --> 00:04:20,360
and regulatory loopholes,

78
00:04:20,560 --> 00:04:22,640
allowing a former executive, Wu,

79
00:04:22,760 --> 00:04:24,160
to disregard the law

80
00:04:24,160 --> 00:04:26,440
and business ethics for personal gain,

81
00:04:26,640 --> 00:04:28,080
engaging in illegal activities

82
00:04:28,080 --> 00:04:29,880
that severely damaged

83
00:04:29,880 --> 00:04:31,480
consumer rights

84
00:04:31,640 --> 00:04:34,240
and industry credibility.

85
00:04:34,760 --> 00:04:37,120
And after the incident,

86
00:04:37,280 --> 00:04:38,920
the company failed to take

87
00:04:38,920 --> 00:04:41,120
a reasonable and responsible solution.

88
00:04:41,360 --> 00:04:43,240
There is serious management

89
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:45,000
and supervisory negligence.

90
00:04:45,160 --> 00:04:46,120
This incident

91
00:04:53,880 --> 00:04:56,880
has caused great inconvenience and harm to consumers,

92
00:04:57,160 --> 00:05:00,240
and has also caused a great negative impact on society.

93
00:05:03,080 --> 00:05:03,880
Regarding this,

94
00:05:03,960 --> 00:05:05,480
on behalf of the group,

95
00:05:05,480 --> 00:05:07,640
I sincerely apologize.

96
00:05:07,840 --> 00:05:09,880
We will reflect deeply,

97
00:05:10,240 --> 00:05:12,280
improve our corporate governance,

98
00:05:12,480 --> 00:05:15,160
and prevent this from happening again.

99
00:05:40,520 --> 00:05:42,960
People like me, who know the full truth,

100
00:05:43,400 --> 00:05:45,400
watching your poor performance from below,

101
00:05:46,200 --> 00:05:47,680
it's truly a waste of time

102
00:05:47,920 --> 00:05:48,600
and a joke.

103
00:05:49,560 --> 00:05:50,360
Jiang Li,

104
00:05:51,480 --> 00:05:53,800
how dare you show up in front of me?

105
00:05:54,880 --> 00:05:55,640
What?

106
00:05:56,360 --> 00:05:58,640
Do you want to deal with me

107
00:05:59,440 --> 00:06:00,920
like you did to my sister?

108
00:06:03,240 --> 00:06:04,760
You're really something.

109
00:06:05,760 --> 00:06:07,120
But you think

110
00:06:07,320 --> 00:06:08,920
you can beat me like this?

111
00:06:09,800 --> 00:06:11,200
My dear mother-in-law,

112
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:14,160
I'm relieved to see you still want to fight.

113
00:06:14,760 --> 00:06:17,000
Because you don't even have a chance to surrender.

114
00:06:17,880 --> 00:06:19,800
You think Uncle Wu will take on everything,

115
00:06:20,040 --> 00:06:21,240
and you just read a light apology statement

116
00:06:21,240 --> 00:06:23,120
in front of the media,

117
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:24,400
and it's all over?

118
00:06:24,920 --> 00:06:27,440
The blood debt you owe hasn't even started.

119
00:06:28,320 --> 00:06:32,000
That farce was just an appetizer.

120
00:06:55,120 --> 00:06:56,240
It's you.

121
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:06,840
Aren't you curious why I'm here?

122
00:07:08,120 --> 00:07:10,800
My naughty daughter ran away from home for a few days.

123
00:07:11,400 --> 00:07:12,840
She suffered a bit outside.

124
00:07:13,040 --> 00:07:14,080
Now she knows to come back.

125
00:07:14,440 --> 00:07:15,720
What's there to be curious about?

126
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:20,960
From childhood to adulthood,

127
00:07:22,720 --> 00:07:26,000
have you ever, even for a moment,

128
00:07:26,960 --> 00:07:29,400
really treated me as your daughter?

129
00:07:30,800 --> 00:07:33,160
Does it matter now?

130
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:35,400
At least I raised you,

131
00:07:35,760 --> 00:07:39,040
gave you a wealthy life.

132
00:07:41,360 --> 00:07:43,480
Give me custody of Mumu.

133
00:07:44,480 --> 00:07:45,720
I'm his mother.

134
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:47,680
I can take care of him.

135
00:07:51,920 --> 00:07:53,240
If you want to go,

136
00:07:53,600 --> 00:07:54,920
you can leave at any time.

137
00:07:55,760 --> 00:07:58,080
But Mumu must stay in the Lu family.

138
00:07:58,800 --> 00:08:00,440
He's Lu Xu's son,

139
00:08:00,720 --> 00:08:02,800
the future heir of the Lu family.

140
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:05,960
He must grow up under the protection of the Lu family,

141
00:08:05,960 --> 00:08:09,440
not with a fool who can't see the situation.

142
00:08:09,920 --> 00:08:10,520
Wake up.

143
00:08:10,520 --> 00:08:10,960
President An,

144
00:08:11,320 --> 00:08:13,600
do you still think you can control everything?

145
00:08:13,760 --> 00:08:15,600
You can't even protect yourself.

146
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:18,320
If you don't give me custody of Mumu,

147
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:21,240
I won't mind stabbing a few knives

148
00:08:21,240 --> 00:08:22,280
and sprinkling some salt

149
00:08:22,320 --> 00:08:23,320
on the wounds Jiang Li tore open.

150
00:08:23,760 --> 00:08:25,240
After all, what she exposed

151
00:08:25,680 --> 00:08:28,240
is just the tip of the iceberg of your dirty tricks.

152
00:08:28,600 --> 00:08:29,560
Isn't it?

153
00:08:31,120 --> 00:08:34,240
I'll give you time to think it over.

154
00:08:41,840 --> 00:08:44,840
Do you think Jiang Li can take me down?

155
00:08:45,360 --> 00:08:47,160
Do you think I don't have a backup plan?

156
00:08:47,760 --> 00:08:50,160
You could have been a puppet.

157
00:08:50,320 --> 00:08:52,320
But you have to go the way to death.

158
00:09:02,560 --> 00:09:03,600
Let Lu Qianqian go.

159
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:13,800
Try

160
00:09:13,800 --> 00:09:14,880
the new beans.

161
00:09:14,880 --> 00:09:16,200
It's the flavor you like.

162
00:09:16,360 --> 00:09:17,160
Thank you.

163
00:09:18,160 --> 00:09:18,920
There's none for you.

164
00:09:18,920 --> 00:09:19,600
You don't deserve it.

165
00:09:19,600 --> 00:09:20,400
You scum!

166
00:09:26,880 --> 00:09:28,360
No need to beat around the bush.

167
00:09:29,320 --> 00:09:31,280
I know you've joined forces with Zhuang Wan.

168
00:09:31,840 --> 00:09:33,320
And you took advantage of the chaos

169
00:09:33,880 --> 00:09:36,440
to acquire shares of Golden Thread from individual investors.

170
00:09:36,760 --> 00:09:37,720
You're moving fast.

171
00:09:38,160 --> 00:09:39,200
Indeed.

172
00:09:41,760 --> 00:09:43,600
I've already divorced Lu Qianqian.

173
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:47,360
And I was kicked out of the management team of Golden Thread.

174
00:09:47,640 --> 00:09:50,320
Now I have nothing but

175
00:09:50,320 --> 00:09:51,080
a few shares.

176
00:09:51,080 --> 00:09:51,960
I'm infamous.

177
00:09:52,120 --> 00:09:55,640
I have to find a way out for myself.

178
00:09:57,760 --> 00:09:58,560
Jiang Li.

179
00:09:58,960 --> 00:10:00,520
All those who have hurt your sister

180
00:10:00,520 --> 00:10:01,720
and the Su family,

181
00:10:01,720 --> 00:10:03,760
Qianqian and Annie

182
00:10:04,080 --> 00:10:07,640
have paid the price to some extent.

183
00:10:07,960 --> 00:10:08,960
They have been punished.

184
00:10:09,960 --> 00:10:10,880
Stop it.

185
00:10:11,120 --> 00:10:12,360
Don't continue.

186
00:10:14,480 --> 00:10:15,280
Stop?

187
00:10:18,280 --> 00:10:19,120
Fine.

188
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:22,160
I'll give you a way out.

189
00:10:22,600 --> 00:10:24,960
At the upcoming shareholders' meeting,

190
00:10:24,960 --> 00:10:26,520
I want you to support my proposal

191
00:10:26,720 --> 00:10:29,240
to establish a new charity foundation.

192
00:10:29,280 --> 00:10:33,480
I'll put 90% of Golden Thread's annual profits into it

193
00:10:33,760 --> 00:10:35,240
to compensate past victims

194
00:10:35,720 --> 00:10:37,560
and support related public welfare industries.

195
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:40,560
Ninety percent?

196
00:10:45,560 --> 00:10:47,440
Are you kidding me?

197
00:10:53,880 --> 00:10:54,320
Jiang Li,

198
00:10:54,320 --> 00:10:55,360
are you crazy?

199
00:10:56,800 --> 00:10:58,680
This is like committing slow suicide.

200
00:10:58,680 --> 00:11:00,280
Golden Thread will collapse immediately.

201
00:11:00,560 --> 00:11:01,080
Besides,

202
00:11:01,080 --> 00:11:02,240
no investor

203
00:11:02,240 --> 00:11:03,880
would accept such a term.

204
00:11:03,880 --> 00:11:04,680
No one.

205
00:11:05,160 --> 00:11:06,480
Annie would never accept it.

206
00:11:07,160 --> 00:11:08,920
It doesn't matter whether Annie accepts it or not.

207
00:11:10,840 --> 00:11:13,480
But Golden Thread must do this.

208
00:11:14,320 --> 00:11:15,880
This is my only condition.

209
00:11:17,280 --> 00:11:19,360
Otherwise, I have no reason to let go of this

210
00:11:19,360 --> 00:11:22,960
bloodthirsty company built on the flesh and blood of countless victims.

211
00:11:23,840 --> 00:11:25,120
It shouldn't exist.

212
00:11:25,680 --> 00:11:27,960
At least not in its current form.

213
00:11:48,600 --> 00:11:49,400
Tell me.

214
00:12:02,800 --> 00:12:03,600
What happened?

215
00:12:05,080 --> 00:12:08,320
Today, as usual, I went to the young master's room to clean.

216
00:12:08,640 --> 00:12:11,280
I saw Old Madam on the floor.

217
00:12:11,440 --> 00:12:12,960
and the Young Master standing beside her,

218
00:12:13,120 --> 00:12:14,280
holding a knife

219
00:12:14,760 --> 00:12:16,120
with blood on it.

220
00:12:23,520 --> 00:12:24,320
Then,

221
00:12:24,880 --> 00:12:25,920
where are the others?

222
00:12:27,120 --> 00:12:27,920
Where's Lu Xu?

223
00:12:28,760 --> 00:12:29,560
Where's Qianqian?

224
00:12:30,320 --> 00:12:32,440
The police took the Young Master away.

225
00:12:32,680 --> 00:12:35,640
The Madam should have gone to the police station for questioning.

226
00:12:36,440 --> 00:12:39,120
Go check on Lu Qianqian and Lu Xu first.

227
00:12:39,680 --> 00:12:40,920
I'll stay here.

228
00:12:47,840 --> 00:12:48,840
Don't worry.

229
00:12:48,960 --> 00:12:51,680
I don't want her to die now more than you do.

230
00:12:55,760 --> 00:12:57,040
If anything happens,

231
00:12:58,120 --> 00:12:59,480
call me immediately.

232
00:12:59,920 --> 00:13:00,920
Okay.

233
00:13:34,800 --> 00:13:36,400
Let me peel an orange for you.

234
00:13:38,240 --> 00:13:38,560
Oh.

235
00:13:38,560 --> 00:13:39,080
Right.

236
00:13:39,080 --> 00:13:39,920
I forgot

237
00:13:40,360 --> 00:13:41,920
you can't eat anything now.

238
00:13:43,320 --> 00:13:44,240
What a pity.

239
00:13:44,760 --> 00:13:46,920
Let me tell you a secret to cheer you up.

240
00:13:47,720 --> 00:13:49,920
I sent someone to tell you

241
00:13:50,240 --> 00:13:52,480
where Lu Qianqian took Xiao Mumu.

242
00:13:53,000 --> 00:13:56,040
I also told Lu Qianqian

243
00:13:56,280 --> 00:13:58,520
that you took the child away secretly.

244
00:13:58,840 --> 00:14:00,520
As for your precious son Lu Xu,

245
00:14:02,120 --> 00:14:03,600
he woke up long ago.

246
00:14:04,960 --> 00:14:06,160
But I didn't expect

247
00:14:06,400 --> 00:14:07,800
he would be so obedient.

248
00:14:08,040 --> 00:14:09,400
For Lu Qianqian

249
00:14:09,680 --> 00:14:11,280
and to get Mumu,

250
00:14:11,560 --> 00:14:12,960
he has been pretending to be asleep.

251
00:14:14,720 --> 00:14:16,400
I know you are awake

252
00:14:16,760 --> 00:14:18,840
and you can hear every word I say.

253
00:14:19,440 --> 00:14:21,360
About the information of Annie's background,

254
00:14:21,760 --> 00:14:24,080
I asked Jenny to give it to you on purpose.

255
00:14:24,640 --> 00:14:27,800
About the part of Lu Qianqian and Mumu,

256
00:14:28,160 --> 00:14:30,320
I believe you must have read it carefully.

257
00:14:31,080 --> 00:14:32,680
I know you love Lu Qianqian very much,

258
00:14:33,400 --> 00:14:35,240
and you can do anything for her.

259
00:14:35,560 --> 00:14:36,920
I can help you,

260
00:14:37,080 --> 00:14:39,480
and even help you get the child you want.

261
00:14:40,560 --> 00:14:44,240
But to see everyone's true face

262
00:14:44,240 --> 00:14:46,120
and know the truth of everything,

263
00:14:47,120 --> 00:14:49,040
then just keep sleeping.

264
00:14:49,560 --> 00:14:51,080
Don't tell anyone.

265
00:14:53,960 --> 00:14:56,080
I know you don't believe me

266
00:14:56,560 --> 00:14:58,240
and think this is another trap.

267
00:14:59,360 --> 00:15:01,120
But what if I tell you

268
00:15:01,440 --> 00:15:04,040
a secret about your life that even Annie

269
00:15:04,200 --> 00:15:06,440
doesn't know?

270
00:15:07,200 --> 00:15:11,000
And a secret that can explain everything.

271
00:15:14,240 --> 00:15:15,800
This secret is that

272
00:15:16,480 --> 00:15:19,440
your precious son Lu Xu

273
00:15:20,320 --> 00:15:21,840
is not your biological son.

274
00:15:22,360 --> 00:15:24,080
And your daughter Lu Qianqian,

275
00:15:24,080 --> 00:15:26,000
whom you have always used and hated,

276
00:15:26,120 --> 00:15:27,680
is your biological daughter.

277
00:15:32,320 --> 00:15:33,360
All of this,

278
00:15:34,680 --> 00:15:35,920
from beginning to end,

279
00:15:36,200 --> 00:15:37,120
is a huge trap

280
00:15:37,120 --> 00:15:39,440
designed by Grandpa Lu for you.

281
00:15:40,480 --> 00:15:42,000
You've been struggling

282
00:15:42,320 --> 00:15:43,520
for years,

283
00:15:43,960 --> 00:15:46,480
thinking you've escaped his trap

284
00:15:46,760 --> 00:15:47,880
and won everything.

285
00:15:48,880 --> 00:15:49,920
But in fact,

286
00:15:50,120 --> 00:15:53,040
you're still in the cage he made for you.

287
00:15:54,520 --> 00:15:56,200
You don't have to believe me,

288
00:15:57,760 --> 00:15:59,600
but I have no reason to lie to you.

289
00:16:00,560 --> 00:16:01,360
Jiang Li,

290
00:16:03,600 --> 00:16:06,640
do you have to see me dead to be satisfied?

291
00:16:08,560 --> 00:16:09,320
Death?

292
00:16:12,120 --> 00:16:13,920
That's too easy.

293
00:16:14,920 --> 00:16:16,720
It's just liberation.

294
00:16:17,920 --> 00:16:19,400
I want you to live.

295
00:16:20,120 --> 00:16:21,200
Watch carefully.

296
00:16:21,680 --> 00:16:23,680
You used all your tricks

297
00:16:24,080 --> 00:16:25,280
and gambled your life

298
00:16:25,600 --> 00:16:26,800
to build this castle

299
00:16:26,800 --> 00:16:28,760
of wealth and power.

300
00:16:28,840 --> 00:16:31,800
I'll destroy it, layer by layer,

301
00:16:31,960 --> 00:16:32,800
and smashed it,

302
00:16:32,840 --> 00:16:34,600
leaving it in ruins.

303
00:16:35,240 --> 00:16:36,080
And you,

304
00:16:37,760 --> 00:16:38,920
can only watch,

305
00:16:39,080 --> 00:16:40,200
powerless.

306
00:16:40,640 --> 00:16:41,920
I want to see

307
00:16:42,080 --> 00:16:45,120
how your soul, nourished by filthy blood,

308
00:16:45,560 --> 00:16:47,600
rots, stinks, and withers

309
00:16:47,600 --> 00:16:50,920
inside that body.

310
00:16:51,760 --> 00:16:52,680
And you,

311
00:16:53,120 --> 00:16:56,400
won't even have a chance to stop it for a second.

312
00:17:14,440 --> 00:17:16,280
Perhaps one day in the future,

313
00:17:16,280 --> 00:17:18,240
you will have the chance to spit on my grave.

314
00:17:18,560 --> 00:17:20,000
But before that,

315
00:17:20,360 --> 00:17:22,360
I will definitely turn you into a

316
00:17:22,720 --> 00:17:23,520
dried up,

317
00:17:24,320 --> 00:17:25,160
living,

318
00:17:25,560 --> 00:17:26,440
soulless

319
00:17:26,760 --> 00:17:28,200
zombie.
